          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Thank you for choosing Stone House Grain as your trusted supplier of high-quality feed and grain products. To ensure a smooth and efficient shipping or pick-up process, we offer three types of shipping/pick-up options. We have a 5 business day lead-time for all orders.  Please review the guidelines below to determine the appropriate method for your order.</p>"
