            "image_rotation_degrees": -2,
            "subheading": "Single Bags, Pallets and Totes",
            "title": "Pick-Up",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Pick-Up is available for Single bag feed orders, 1 ton of </strong>palleted<strong> bags, and 1 ton totes only.</strong></li><li>Customers are required to bring appropriate transportation to support the ordered quantity, whether it's single bags, palleted bags, or totes.</li><li>A 1 ton minimum per feed type is required for bulk pickup.  For pick ups of more than 1 ton of the same feed we will only fill ONE container (i.e. a wagon or multi-ton bin).  We will NOT fill multiple containers.</li><li>Please allow up to 5 business days for your order to be processed and ready for pick up.</li><li>Walk-in customers are welcome for single bag orders. Payment will be due at the time of pick-up for walk-in orders.</li></ul>",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_text": ""
          }
        }
      },
